-- name: Master Section
-- description: One row per course section-offering (2024+), the analysis workhorse. Institution enrichment (state, control, level, size, sector, IPEDS enrollment), material/required/optional counts (course materials only — #36 supplies excluded, audited by is_supply/supply_count), OER/IA indicators + counts, ISBN/FormatType coverage, enrollment fill-potential flags plus the persisted numeric fill enrollment_assigned/enrollment_source (#32), and required/optional cost columns (min/max/owned, (min+max)/2 avg). Slice this in the GUI notebook builder (filter by period_sortable, control, level, sector, state; group by any dimension) — no SQL needed. Backed by a materialized table, so browsing is cheap. Gotchas: period_sortable YYYY-N (4=Fall); state 'CAN'=Canada, blank=unknown country; *_cost_avg=(min+max)/2 (NOT a mean); seats_taken=9999 is an invalid sentinel.
SELECT * FROM master_section
